id: flash-stage-zfit
section: The suite's own
item: A gesture named in stage coordinates lands within 3 stage pixels, by the instrumented movie's report, in each scale mode, at the page zoom fit
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-flash-instr.html?movie=avm2&scale=showAll&w=300&h=150&fit=1
kit: cavekit-flash.md R2
wait text ready stage= 30
flash-tap m 400 300 showAll 200 150
expect flash-at 200 150 3
flash-tap m 400 300 showAll 150 120
expect flash-at 150 120 3
launch http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-flash-instr.html?movie=avm2&scale=noBorder&w=300&h=150&fit=1
wait text ready stage= 30
flash-tap m 400 300 noBorder 200 150
expect flash-at 200 150 3
flash-tap m 400 300 noBorder 150 120
expect flash-at 150 120 3
launch http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-flash-instr.html?movie=avm2&scale=exactFit&w=300&h=150&fit=1
wait text ready stage= 30
flash-tap m 400 300 exactFit 200 150
expect flash-at 200 150 3
flash-tap m 400 300 exactFit 150 120
expect flash-at 150 120 3
launch http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-flash-instr.html?movie=avm2&scale=noScale&w=300&h=150&fit=1
wait text ready stage= 30
flash-tap m 400 300 noScale 200 150
expect flash-at 200 150 3
flash-tap m 400 300 noScale 150 120
expect flash-at 150 120 3
